      "title": "Computer Technician II",
      "description": "Indiana State University Employment Opportunities | Computer Technician II Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Computer Technician II Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. All student employees will be required to submit employment verification documents on their first day of work. For a list of acceptable documentation, follow this link: student-employment-list-of-acceptable-documents.pdf Position Details Position Details Student Employment Enrollment Requirements Indiana State University student enrolled in at least 6 credit hours. Comments to Applicants All student employees will be required to submit employment verification documents on their first day of work. For a list of acceptable documentation, follow this link: student-employment-list-of-acceptable-documents.pdf Notice of Vacancy Number ST2600180 Job Title Computer Technician II Job Category Regular Student Job Job Type Regular Student Jobs Position Class Code 82100 Student Employee Student Pay Grade 999 Hourly Wage/Salary $13 Job Summary/Basic Function This job will involve training for Computer Repair or Computer Acquisitions for the Technology Support Center. Specific Responsibilities Work Schedule Monday – Friday 7:30 am – 5:00 pm Some weekends may be required. Desired Start Date 09/07/2026 Open Date 08/31/2026 Close Date 09/30/2026 Required Relevant Education & Experience High School diploma or GED Required Field(s) of Study Indiana State University student enrolled in at least 6 credit hours. Preferred Relevant Education and Experience NA Supervisory Responsibilities This job has no supervisory responsibilities. Required Certificates, Licenses and Registrations Other Required Certificates, Licenses and Registrations Preferred Certificates, Licenses and Registrations A+ Certification, Microsoft Certifications Preferred Other Certificates, Licenses and Registration