chnology Competency: Oral/Written Communications Competency: Teamwork/Collaboration Competency: Career and Self Development Competency: Professionalism/Work Ethic Applicant Documents Required Documents Optional Documents Resume Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * What social media platforms do you use and how often? (Open Ended Question) * Do you have experience creating reels and and editing videos for social media Yes No * Are you currently in good academic standing with the University? Yes No * Are you currently in good conduct standing with the University? Yes No To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
